      ],
      "requirement": "Preserve the explicit January 28 [1856] receipt of Phillips’s book as a physical arrival event. The body thanks Phillips for the present in return for Darwin’s “old & dry works on Rocks”; it does not establish that Darwin had read the whole book, and the missing Phillips cover cannot be reconstructed. Darwin’s prior offer is extant in1822 and is not missing. Keep publication/library identification in apparatus rather than replacing the body’s limited receipt claim.",
